===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|kipe}}, {{m|enm|kype}}, from {{inh|en|ang|cȳpe}}, {{m|ang|cȳpa||basket}}, akin to {{cog|gml|kīpe}} {{gloss|"basket"; > {{cog|nds-de|Kiep}}, {{m|nds-de|Kiepke||basket}}, {{cog|de|Kiepe}}}}, {{cog|no|kaup||wooden box; crate}}.

